  'ia.sys.date-documents': 'Identify a document’s date with the AI, when the first pass is not sure',
  'ia.wf.action.date': 'Identify a document’s date with the AI',
  'ia.wf.action.date.desc': 'When the first pass without AI did not read it surely: the file name and the start of the document’s text are given to the AI. Certain, and the document says it: the date is given (“identified by the AI”); otherwise it stays to confirm.',
  'ia.wf.date.system': 'You read the start of a document to find its date: that of its edition, publication or signature — not a deadline, a due date, nor a date quoted in the text. Answer in JSON: date — as YYYY-MM-DD (YYYY-MM if only the month is given), empty if the document gives none —, and certain: true only if the document clearly shows it.',
