  'ia.sys.emetteur-documents': 'Identify the company that issues a document with the AI, when the first pass is not sure',
  'ia.wf.action.issuer': 'Identify a document’s company with the AI',
  'ia.wf.action.issuer.desc': 'When the first pass without AI did not read it surely: the start of the document’s text is given to the AI. Certain, and the document says it: the company is given (“identified by the AI”); otherwise it stays to confirm.',
  'ia.wf.issuer.known': 'The known issuers (code (name)): {list}. If it is one of them, answer with its code.',
  'ia.wf.issuer.system': 'You read the start of a document to find its issuer: the company, body or buyer who wrote or published it (on its cover page, header, title block), not a recipient, a quoted supplier nor a standard. Answer in JSON: issuer — its name as the document writes it, empty if it does not say —, and certain: true only if the document clearly says it. Invent nothing: the issuer must appear in the text.',
  'ia.wf.issuer.found': '“{title}”: issued by “{issuer}”, identified by the AI.',
