  'ia.wf.title.system': 'You read the start of a document to find its title: the one on its cover page or header (“Particular technical specifications — Ground station”), not the company name, a reference, a date or a chapter heading. Answer in JSON: title — the title as the document writes it, not copied in capitals if it is in upper case —, and certain: true only if the document clearly says it. Invent nothing: the title must come from the text.',
