  'ia.wf.action.identity.desc': 'When the first pass without AI did not read them surely: the start of the document’s text is given to the AI. Certain, what it says is given (“identified by the AI”); otherwise they stay to confirm.',
  'ia.wf.identity.system': 'You read the start of a document to find how it identifies itself: its reference (its code — “DLA-NM-0000000-01-PSP”, “ECSS-E-ST-10C”, “CCTP-2026-118” —, not that of another document it quotes), its edition and its revision (“Issue 2”, “Revision 15”, “Rev. B”, “Index C”; “Version 2.1”: edition 2, revision 1). Answer in JSON: reference, edition, revision — empty if it does not say them —, and certain: true only if the document clearly says them. Invent nothing: the reference must appear as it is in the text or the file name.',
